    <li><a href="https://akurasu.net/wiki/Super_Robot_Wars/Neo/Secrets" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Akurasu Wiki — Super Robot Wars Neo: Secrets</a>（隐藏要素总表，与流程图交叉核对）</li>
    <li><a href="https://srw.wiki.cre.jp/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E8%A9%B1%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7/NEO" rel="noopener" target="_blank">srw.wiki — 全話一覧/NEO</a>（话数口径、分支结构与标题的交叉核对）</li>
    <li><a href="https://gamefaqs.gamespot.com/wii/960812-super-robot-taisen-neo/faqs/58348" rel="noopener" target="_blank">CO_Adder — Super Robot Taisen Neo Guide and Walkthrough</a>（GameFAQs faqs/58348；敌方编成的单一来源，覆盖第1话–第38话地球线，本站未导入、待裁决）</li>
